@startuml
title class diagram - image subscriber and video track

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace

class ImageSubscriber <<rclpy.node.Node>> {
  +bridge: CvBridge
  -_frame_sink: LatestFrameVideoTrack
  -_event_loop: asyncio.AbstractEventLoop
  -_image_topic: str
  -_subscription
  +callback(msg: sensor_msgs/Image): void
  +main(args): void
}

class LatestFrameVideoTrack <<aiortc.VideoStreamTrack>> {
  -_frame: numpy.ndarray | None
  -_new_frame_event: asyncio.Event
  +update_frame(frame: numpy.ndarray): void
  +recv(): VideoFrame
}

class CvBridge {
  +imgmsg_to_cv2(msg, desired_encoding): ndarray
}

class VideoFrame {
  +from_ndarray(frame, format): VideoFrame
  +pts
  +time_base
}

ImageSubscriber --> CvBridge : converts ROS Image to BGR
ImageSubscriber --> LatestFrameVideoTrack : call_soon_threadsafe(update_frame)
LatestFrameVideoTrack --> VideoFrame : creates aiortc frame

note bottom of LatestFrameVideoTrack
  Keeps only the newest frame.
  No replay queue is used for camera video.
end note

@enduml
